\end{enumerate}

In the second variant, the point set $\P\subset\IR^2$ such that $|\P|=n$. For hitting similarly sized homothetic regular $k$-gons, we obtain a randomized algorithm with a competitive ratio of~$O(\log n\log M)$, partially answering an open question for squares~\cite{AlefkhaniKM23, KhanLRSW23}.  We state the following open problems.
