Let $K_s^{\tau}$ be the convex cone with apex $o_{\tau}$ spanned by the tile~$s$ (see Figure~\ref{fig:cone1}). Here, we give an upper bound of the opening angle of $K_s^{\tau}$. 

\begin{lemma}\label{lemma:cone}
    The opening angle of the cone $K_s^{\tau}$ is strictly less than $\frac{\pi}{2}$. In particular, when $\sigma$ is a  regular $k$-gon with  $k\geq 4$, the opening angle of the cone $K_s^{\tau}$ is strictly less than $\frac{\pi}{4}$.
