\begin{lemma}\label{lemma:psLine_k_s}
    For any pair of objects $\sigma',\sigma'' \in {\cal D}_{s,\tau}$, the intersection $\partial\sigma'\cap \partial\sigma''\cap K_s^{\tau}$ consists of at most one connected component of $\partial\sigma'\cap\partial \sigma''$.
