Heer~\etal~\cite{Heer:2012:InteractiveDynamicsTasks} proposed a high-level task for 2D visual analytics based on the steps of viewing, manipulating, and processing data. 
Besançon~\etal~\cite{Besançon:2021:3DVisTasks} organized 3D visualization tasks into three high-level task groups.
Although these taxonomies are applicable to a wide range of data types and are not limited to specific environments, they do not lie within the same hierarchical scope.
