The space \( \mathbb{H}(\bdiv_s; \mathcal{D}) \) is defined to consist of matrix-valued functions whose rows belong to \( \mathbf{H}(\text{div}_s; \mathcal{D}) \), and it is endowed with the norm \( \| \cdot \|_{\bdiv_s; \mathcal{D}} \).
