			\sup_{\mathbf{0}\neq \bet\in \mathbf{H}}\dfrac{\mathscr{B}^C(\bet, \vec{\psi})}{\Vert \bet\Vert_{\mathbf{H}}}\,\geq\,\beta_{C}\,\Vert \vec{\psi}\Vert_{\mathcal{V}}\qquad\forall\, \psi\in \mathcal{V} \,,\label{eq:inf.bit}
