From the {\it a priori} estimates for $\mathscr{T}^F$ (Lemma \ref{l_wel.S}, Eq.~\eqref{eq:apr1}) and $\mathscr{T}^C$ (Lemma \ref{l_wel.T}, Eq.~\eqref{eq:apr2}), we deduce the existence of a constant $\mathcal{L}_{\mathscr{T}}$, depending only on $\mathcal{L}_{\mathscr{T}^F}$, $\mathcal{L}_{\mathscr{T}^C}$, $\mathcal{C}_{\mathscr{T}^F}$, and $\mathcal{C}_{\mathscr{T}^C}$, such that for all $(\bz,\chi), (\by,\omega) \in \mathbf{W}(r)$, the following holds
