Similarly, using the second row of \eqref{eq:dis.sub1} and the inclusion \( \bdiv(\mathbb{H}_h) \subseteq \mathbf{V}_h \) (cf.~\cite[Lemma 3.7]{g-springer-2014}), an analogue of \eqref{eq:f7} holds:
	\begin{equation}\label{eq:dis.f7}
