The experimental setup for the ICL method aligns with that of TKG-ICL \cite{lee2023temporal}, except for a change in the model. The input provided to the model is based on indexing rather than lexical content. For the 20B model, due to computational resource constraints, we employed a 4-bit quantization approach for loading the model and performing inference. All experiments were conducted on GeForce RTX 3090 GPU with 24GB Memory. 

