\[\term[3]_{\mathcal{D}} \defeq (\aE \aW)^{\lop} (\aW \aE)^{\lop} (\aN \aS)^{\lop} (\aS \aN)^{\lop} (\aE \aN \aW \aS)^{\lop}  (\term[3]_{c_1} \union_{c_1} (\term[3]_{c_2} \union_{c_2} \dots ((\term[3]_{c_n} \union_{c_n} \emp) )))^{\lop}.\]
Note that $\DREL_{\mathtt{test}, \Gamma_{\mathcal{D}}}^{\mathrm{fin}} = \DREL^{\mathrm{fin}}_{\mathtt{test}, (\aE \union \aN \union \aW \union \aS)^* \ge \top, \term[3]_{\mathcal{D}} \ge \eps}$.
