\subsection{Research Question}
We formulate the following research questions to evaluate the effectiveness of RAG-Reviewer:
\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{RQ1:} Does RAG-Reviewer outperform existing baseline methods in terms of review comment generation quality?
    \item \textbf{RQ2:} Does RAG-Reviewer mitigate the challenges faced by language models in generating low-frequency tokens?
    \item \textbf{RQ3:} What is the impact of the number of retrieved exemplars on the performance of RAG-Reviewer?
\end{itemize}
