TCI's causal intervention is validated via  cross-modal matching statistics (Figure~\ref{fig7}(c)). The baseline exhibits biased matching visual embeddings of atomic actions from ``make scrambled eggs''  with the textual embeddings of ``make pancake'', while CMDCL shows precise matching of causal atomic actions like ``stirfry egg'' to their corresponding long-term actions. 
